    "name": "Warja",
    "steam_appid": 2433360,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433360/extras/dad64df7dc418de82792883e747d859a.avif?t=1751911765\" /></span><br>Warja is a pixel art roguelite tower defence game where you collect loot, upgrade towers, and level up your hero to defend against endless waves of monsters.<br><br>Each defence is different as you mix and match loadouts, get random item drops, unlock new items for future playthroughs, try out new heroes and skill paths, experience different random events, and adapt to randomly generated maps!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433360/extras/e8a60b5205e0a7f8b3a8a3c71881fc4b.avif?t=1751911765\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play as different heroes each with their own strengths and weaknesses<br></li><li>Unlock new towers, skills, and abilities for your favourite hero<br></li><li>Heaps of items with unique effects to equip on your towers<br></li><li>Unlock new difficulties and gameplay-changing relics to keep future playthroughs interesting<br></li><li>Play through several maps with different interactions, hazards, and randomly generated paths<br></li><li>Random events that can help or hinder you<br></li><li>Open ended gameplay that lets you reach broken power levels<br></li><li>Every playthrough reveals new possibilities. How will you shape your defense this time?</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433360/extras/9067b61393bd0c6b234e15fec49dab38.avif?t=1751911765\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433360/extras/dad64df7dc418de82792883e747d859a.avif?t=1751911765\" /></span><br>Warja is a pixel art roguelite tower defence game where you collect loot, upgrade towers, and level up your hero to defend against endless waves of monsters.<br><br>Each defence is different as you mix and match loadouts, get random item drops, unlock new items for future playthroughs, try out new heroes and skill paths, experience different random events, and adapt to randomly generated maps!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433360/extras/e8a60b5205e0a7f8b3a8a3c71881fc4b.avif?t=1751911765\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play as different heroes each with their own strengths and weaknesses<br></li><li>Unlock new towers, skills, and abilities for your favourite hero<br></li><li>Heaps of items with unique effects to equip on your towers<br></li><li>Unlock new difficulties and gameplay-changing relics to keep future playthroughs interesting<br></li><li>Play through several maps with different interactions, hazards, and randomly generated paths<br></li><li>Random events that can help or hinder you<br></li><li>Open ended gameplay that lets you reach broken power levels<br></li><li>Every playthrough reveals new possibilities. How will you shape your defense this time?</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433360/extras/9067b61393bd0c6b234e15fec49dab38.avif?t=1751911765\" /></span>",
